---

# 15. Fault Types

Possible fault types include:

```text
Water Leak
Burst Pipe
No Water
Low Water Pressure
Damaged Infrastructure
Water Wastage
Other
```

Additional fault types can be added as the project develops.

---

# 16. Fault Status

The application uses statuses to track the progress of a report.

```text
SUBMITTED
UNDER_REVIEW
ASSIGNED
IN_PROGRESS
RESOLVED
```

The status workflow is:

```text
SUBMITTED
     │
     ▼
UNDER_REVIEW
     │
     ▼
ASSIGNED
     │
     ▼
IN_PROGRESS
     │
     ▼
RESOLVED
```

---

# 17. Priority

Fault reports can optionally be assigned a priority.

Possible priority levels:

```text
LOW
MEDIUM
HIGH
CRITICAL
```

This allows administrators or maintenance teams to identify faults that require urgent attention.

